Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.08,0:01:24.98,Text A1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1600)\an4\pos(1350,940)}Take me home\NI will warm up\Nyour bed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.83,0:01:25.03,Episode title 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,1600)\pos(544,726)}Meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I name you...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.13,0:01:26.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.19,0:01:28.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You already decided?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.82,0:01:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm "little white", he's "little black".
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.84,0:01:31.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.99,0:01:33.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's rather random...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you named me also rather randomly?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On a second thought...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Luo Xiaohei". This name does have profundity.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.87,0:01:41.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He woke up.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.57,0:01:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.29,0:01:47.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you scared him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.47,0:01:52.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.72,0:01:58.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.56,0:02:06.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.32,0:02:09.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom! Where's the plate?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.19,0:02:12.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it wasn't me...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, Xiaohei must have pulled it in there.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think so... Will you check it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.03,0:02:18.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope nothing's wrong...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.99,0:02:19.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's come out.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why for?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.33,0:02:25.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder why he's so obedient now...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did scare him back there.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got a blue tongue.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do cats have blue tongues?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.63,0:02:34.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.30,0:02:35.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.18,0:02:39.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll have to buy cat litter and tray.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.06,0:02:40.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are those for?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll be the cat's toilet.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't he use ours?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me a cat that would sit on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.65,0:02:47.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not just an ordinary cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from, after all?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your owner must have loved you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.09,0:03:17.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must have had no choice but to leave you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be your owner.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Luo Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiao...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a prince who has been cursed.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for lifting the curse off me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By kissing you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.08,0:03:42.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So clichéd...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like to come to my castle tonight?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must properly thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotta go to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.88,0:03:53.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us meet at the weekend, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting! The Sky Pearl was stolen.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.74,0:04:00.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you admit your sin?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.22,0:04:00.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.43,0:04:04.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will definitely recover the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.43,0:04:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done,\Nfor vast is the sea of beings.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.14,0:04:10.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have hit the demon and made him revert to his original form.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.15,0:04:11.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should still be nearby.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. Don't return without the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.03,0:04:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.91,0:05:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.99,0:05:49.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.73,0:05:55.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good kitty! Come here!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be late! Come quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.39,0:06:01.19,Episode title 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\pos(336,720)}Run!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.91,0:06:10.51,Newspaper text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz11.02\pos(750,540)\fs65}I'm the\Nfather
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.41,0:06:09.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom, Xiaohei started to eat your breakfast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.01,0:06:12.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like he won't eat cat food.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucky my first thing today was to buy some.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.65,0:06:16.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way we can share our food with him.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.27,0:06:18.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be going?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.73,0:06:20.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Gotta go to school!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.67,0:06:48.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.98,0:06:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.76,0:07:30.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.61,0:08:48.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei tried to run away?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.98,0:08:51.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he somehow opened the door.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.07,0:08:52.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I caught him and brought him back.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should decide if we let him go or not.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.83,0:08:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.65,0:08:59.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.85,0:09:04.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.09,0:09:06.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.51,0:09:20.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, this place is full of cars and dogs...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.14,0:09:21.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you really want to leave,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.43,0:09:23.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out of town this weekend.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.49,0:09:27.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.03,0:09:37.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.67,0:09:39.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there? Come down!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:41.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hi, Shan Xin!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.55,0:10:41.39,Episode title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\pos(1414,724)}Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.38,0:10:37.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanna see Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.16,0:10:39.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, when can you come over?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the door?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.16,0:10:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Sup.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.43,0:10:44.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.43,0:10:45.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is for Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.31,0:10:49.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll love it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Shan Xin.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.43,0:10:52.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mrs. Luo.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.53,0:10:54.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be cleaning here, you just go play.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.56,0:10:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot your mom always looks like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Sup, {\i1}nihao.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.86,0:11:05.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go say hello to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Huang?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.21,0:11:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like he's scared of him.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cats tend to be quite timid.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not so interested.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.73,0:11:38.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.58,0:11:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see now?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.43,0:11:43.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Catch it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He caught it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.28,0:11:50.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The point is to do your best not to catch it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.36,0:11:53.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.51,0:11:55.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he making fun of me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls! I'm leaving for work!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.28,0:12:01.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you found an excuse again.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.21,0:12:10.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did bring Xiaohuang to meet Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I end up having to take care of him.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.23,0:12:15.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.63,0:12:17.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Horde!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got up, lazy cat?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what happened to your tail?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.51,0:12:49.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your tail!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.38,0:12:52.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So a cat's tail can turn into tiny kitties!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.33,0:12:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei-shu!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Heishu"?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei-shu!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.86,0:13:00.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see, your name's Heishu!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.46,0:13:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come down, Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.03,0:13:20.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be a good kitty!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come down!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.66,0:13:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.03,0:13:26.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, bring him back!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.26,0:14:14.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.61,0:14:15.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm at Xiaobai's.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? You come over?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I'll wait for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huzzah, fair maiden!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.71,0:14:25.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want a silver scale breastplate?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.86,0:14:27.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silver scale breastplate!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First class product!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only 5 golds--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.56,0:14:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.31,0:14:36.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.68,0:14:43.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's on heat.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two can't procreate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From this day on,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.29,0:15:55.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be your faithful servant.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only have to sign this contract, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:00.67,Newspaper text 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz346.4\fad(150,0)\pos(590,775)}insurance
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.05,0:16:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.09,0:16:04.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A minor character.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you finish packing? Don't forget anything!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.80,0:16:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.73,0:16:09.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you called over?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.76,0:16:10.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.40,0:16:11.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who picked it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.53,0:16:12.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cousin Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your school stuff?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're dead!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.19,0:16:15.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got enough socks?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.93,0:16:17.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll wear sandals.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.03,0:16:17.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your toothbrush?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot that!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.05,0:16:30.09,Episode title 4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1600,0)\pos(1104,462)}Fly!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.36,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.92,0:18:18.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come quick, they're gonna fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.93,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can play with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.71,0:19:15.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.41,0:19:18.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's on the roof.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.63,0:19:19.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right! I'll check!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.87,0:19:21.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But no climbing up!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.53,0:19:27.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.80,0:19:28.69,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heishu?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't find him anywhere...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.68,0:19:41.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he must be playing hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what if we won't see him anymore?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.52,0:19:44.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.88,0:19:45.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.65,0:19:47.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.83,0:19:48.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where've you been?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.63,0:19:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that my dress?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.48,0:19:54.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you make it so dirty?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.56,0:19:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad kitty!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:32.71,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:42.15,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:48.35,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:54.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:59.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:03.98,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:10.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:21.82,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:27.24,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:43.51,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:49.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:55.90,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
